3	// First lighting pass: flat per-face base color modulated by the scene lights (ambient + diffuse +
4	// specular). The ND mesh carries no normals; the vertex shader supplies a flat per-face normal (the
5	// projected quad's geometric normal). Normal mapping and weighted-blended OIT transparency come later.
