// Filled orientation arrow pointing +v (the face's local axis2), in [0,1] UV. Returns 1 inside the
// arrow: a triangular head stacked on a rectangular shaft. Drawn per sticker, so it rotates with the
// cubie and reveals its orientation.
float arrowMask(vec2 uv)
{
    vec2 p = uv - 0.5;                                          // center; +y points toward v = 1
